<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>NAPLES, Italy 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an Italian Cup</p>
<p>semifinal second leg match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Napoli		1 - Beto 77</p>
<p>    Internazionale    1 - Zanetti 11</p>
<p>    HT: 0-1    FT: 1-1    ET: 1-1</p>
<p>Aggregate score 2-2</p>
<p>Penalty shootout</p>
<p>    Napoli		5 - Milanese, Caccia, Caio, Turrini,</p>
<p>Boghossian</p>
<p>    Internazionale    3 - Zamorano, Djorkaeff, Pistone</p>
<p>Red card: Ganz (Internazionale) 34</p>
<p>Napoli play Vicenza in the final over two legs on June 4 and</p>
<p>11.</p>
